      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "\"Without me you can do nothing\" Jesus assures us. How then can anyone, believing in Jesus, hope to be temperate in anything without Jesus - how can we be gentle like Him and pure and patient? How be earnest for good: how successful on the battlefield of this short life? In other words, how gain Heaven & escape Hell without frequent Comunion? Dear Owen. Go to Jesus as often as you can -- why not every day? and plead with Him to teach us all \"loving appreci- ation\" of His invitation - His plea to each of us: \"Come to me all ye that labor and are heav'y burdened. With such a standing plea we have no excuse for fail- ing to be saints. Plead too for the grace to love your wife and children for God's sake. . . Alas how little that grace is prayed for! No wonder the divorce plague",
      "per_polygon": "\"Without me you can do nothing\" Jesus assures us. How then can anyone, believing in Jesus, hope to be temperate in anything without Jesus - how can we be gentle like Him and pure and patient? How be earnest for good: how successful on the battlefield of this short life? In other words, how gain Heaven & escape Hell without frequent Comunion? Dear Owen. . Go to Jesus as often as you can -- why not every day? and plead with Him to teach us all \"loving appreci- ation\" of His invitation - His plea to each of us: \"Come to me all ye that labor and are heav'y burdened. With such a standing plea we have no excuse for fail- ing to be saints. Plead too for the grace to love your wife and children for God's sake. . . Alas how little that grace is prayed for! No wonder the divorce plague",
